	(text "VCC 5 V, 70 mA dominant max, 130 mA with a bus fault: 0.42 A from RAW_5V for six in dominant. VIO 3.3 V logic. STB to GND: normal mode, it has an internal pull-up.\nBus pins +/-58 V to GND, +/-45 V differential, TXD dominant timeout. Termination and TVS sit at the port connector on HP. Single fault H or L to 54.6 V: the other line follows through the termination, in range.\nH at 54.6 V and L hard to GND together exceeds +/-45 V: the transceiver may die, nothing burns. Not isolated: see RATIONALE-log."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
